The `people` collection is part of the fixed starter architecture: its key is
declared in src/content.config.ts, it is listed in `graphCollections`, and the
generated course API reports it. This directory is kept so the glob loader has
its base path even while the collection is empty.

It is empty on purpose. The course has no verifiable staff data, and inventing
teaching staff to populate a page is barred by CLAUDE.md §6. Add entries here
when real names and roles exist; the schema and routes are unchanged.
